---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accueil · NESDZ"
  description="NESDZ : briefing vol, journal utile et annuaire ULM pour préparer, comparer et voler plus juste."
>
  <section class="hero home-hero-section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="card home-hero-card-v2">
        <div class="home-hero-topline">Briefing vol · Journal · Annuaire ULM</div>

        <div class="home-hero-main">
          <div class="home-hero-copy">
            <h1>Le site pilote pour préparer, progresser et comparer juste.</h1>

            <p class="home-lead-v2">
              NESDZ réunit un briefing vol simple à ouvrir, un journal utile pour voler plus fin
              et un annuaire clair pour comparer les machines sans folklore.
            </p>

            <div class="home-hero-actions-v2">
              <a class="btn home-primary-btn-v2" href="/outils/">Ouvrir le briefing vol</a>
              <div class="home-hero-links-v2" aria-label="Accès secondaires NESDZ">
                <a href="/journal/">Voir le journal</a>
                <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                <a href="/modeles/">Voir l’annuaire ULM</a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p class="home-hero-note-v2">
              Pour la préparation du vol, les services officiels en vigueur restent la référence.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="home-hero-pillars">
            <a class="home-pillar-link" href="/outils/">
              <span class="home-pillar-kicker">Central</span>
              <strong>Briefing vol</strong>
              <span>Météo terrain, terrains proches, docs officiels utiles et NOTAM officiels.</span>
            </a>

            <a class="home-pillar-link" href="/journal/">
              <span class="home-pillar-kicker">Pour progresser</span>
              <strong>Journal</strong>
              <span>Pilotage, sécurité, météo et culture de vol pour raisonner terrain.</span>
            </a>

            <a class="home-pillar-link" href="/modeles/">
              <span class="home-pillar-kicker">Pour comparer</span>
              <strong>Annuaire ULM</strong>
              <span>Fiches modèles, specs, vidéos et filtres utiles pour comparer sans brochure.</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-journal-section-v2">
    <div class="home-journal-grid-v2">
      <article class="card home-edito-card-v2">
        <div class="pad">
          <div class="home-section-head-v2">
            <div>
              <div class="home-kicker-v2">Édito du mois</div>
              <h2>L’Esprit ULM : Manifeste pour un ciel libre et responsable</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="home-text-link-v2" href="/edito/">Tous les éditos</a>
          </div>

          <a class="home-edito-visual" href="/journal/2026-01-edito-nesdz/" aria-label="Lire l’édito du mois">
            <img src="/articles/edito-esprit-ulm.png" alt="L’Esprit ULM : Manifeste pour un ciel libre et responsable" loading="lazy" />
          </a>

          <p class="home-section-intro-v2">
            Un rendez-vous éditorial pour poser un cap clair : liberté, responsabilité,
            précision, culture de vol et mémoire du terrain.
          </p>

          <div class="home-edito-actions">
            <a class="btn home-primary-btn-v2" href="/journal/2026-01-edito-nesdz/">Lire l’édito</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card home-journal-card-v2">
        <div class="pad">
          <div class="home-section-head-v2">
            <div>
              <h2>Journal</h2>
              <p class="home-section-intro-v2 compact">
                Des articles utiles pour voler plus fin, choisir plus juste et garder des marges.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a class="home-text-link-v2" href="/journal/">Tout lire</a>
          </div>

          <ul class="home-article-list-v2">
            <li class="home-article-item-v2">
              <a class="home-article-link-v2" href="/journal/2026-02-choisir-ulm/">
                <div class="home-article-thumb-v2">
                  <img src="/articles/bienchoisirsonulm.png" alt="Choisir son ULM" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="home-article-copy-v2">
                  <div class="home-article-meta-v2">
                    <time datetime="2026-02-02T00:00:00.000Z">2 févr. 2026</time>
                  </div>
                  <h3>Choisir son ULM : une méthode simple (et anti-auto-mensonge)</h3>
                  <p>
                    Terrain, météo, budget, maintenance et objectifs réels avant les photos.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li class="home-article-item-v2 home-article-item-v2--compact">
              <a class="home-article-link-v2 home-article-link-v2--compact" href="/journal/2025-12-metrologie-du-vent/">
                <div class="home-article-copy-v2">
                  <div class="home-article-meta-v2">
                    <time datetime="2025-12-14T00:00:00.000Z">14 déc. 2025</time>
                  </div>
                  <h3>Lire le vent comme un pilote (pas comme une appli)</h3>
                  <p>
                    Comprendre les indices du terrain pour décider vite, calmement et sans illusion dangereuse.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-model-section-v2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="pad">
        <div class="home-section-head-v2">
          <div>
            <h2>Modèles en vedette</h2>
            <p class="home-section-intro-v2 compact">
              Quelques fiches déjà enrichies pour comparer vite des machines utiles.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="home-text-link-v2" href="/modeles/">Voir l’annuaire ULM</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-model-grid-v2">
          <article class="home-model-card-v2">
            <a class="home-model-overlay-v2" href="/modeles/aeroprakt-a-22-foxbat/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aeroprakt A-22 (Foxbat)"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner-v2">
              <div class="home-model-media-v2">
                <img src="/images/ulm/AeroPrakt-A22-Foxbat.jpg" alt="Aeroprakt A-22 Foxbat" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy-v2">
                <div class="home-model-topline-v2">
                  <h3>Aeroprakt A-22 (Foxbat)</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>Aeroprakt · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 UL / 912 ULS · Croisière ~150 km/h</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags-v2">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/stol/">stol</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/ecole/">école</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/aluminium/">aluminium</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="home-model-card-v2">
            <a class="home-model-overlay-v2" href="/modeles/aeroprakt-a-32-vixxen/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner-v2">
              <div class="home-model-media-v2">
                <img src="/images/ulm/AeroPrakt-A32-Vixxen.jpg" alt="Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy-v2">
                <div class="home-model-topline-v2">
                  <h3>Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>Aeroprakt · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 ULS · Croisière ~175 km/h</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags-v2">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/rapide/">rapide</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/aluminium/">aluminium</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="home-model-card-v2">
            <a class="home-model-overlay-v2" href="/modeles/aerospool-wt9-dynamic/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aerospool WT9 Dynamic"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner-v2">
              <div class="home-model-media-v2">
                <img src="/images/ulm/aerospool-wt9.jpg" alt="Aerospool WT9 Dynamic" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy-v2">
                <div class="home-model-topline-v2">
                  <h3>Aerospool WT9 Dynamic</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>Aerospool · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 ULS</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags-v2">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/rapide/">rapide</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/composite/">composite</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="home-model-card-v2">
            <a class="home-model-overlay-v2" href="/modeles/autogyro-cavalon/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : AutoGyro Cavalon"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner-v2">
              <div class="home-model-media-v2">
                <img src="/images/ulm/AutoGyroCavalon.jpg" alt="AutoGyro Cavalon" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy-v2">
                <div class="home-model-topline-v2">
                  <h3>AutoGyro Cavalon</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>AutoGyro GmbH · Autogire · 2 places · Rotax 915 iS</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags-v2">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag-v2" href="/tags/composite/">composite</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-tags-section-v2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="pad home-tags-wrap-v2">
        <div class="home-section-head-v2 home-section-head-v2--compact">
          <div>
            <h2>Explorer par thèmes</h2>
            <p class="home-section-intro-v2 compact">
              Une entrée courte vers les sujets du journal et les profils utiles de l’annuaire.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="home-text-link-v2" href="/tags/">Tous les tags</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-tag-lines-v2">
          <div class="home-tag-line-v2">
            <strong>Journal</strong>
            <div class="home-theme-pills-v2">
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/pilotage/">pilotage</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/meteo/">météo</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/securite/">sécurité</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="home-tag-line-v2">
            <strong>Modèles ULM</strong>
            <div class="home-theme-pills-v2">
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/ecole/">école</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/polyvalent/">polyvalent</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/stol/">stol</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style is:global>
    .home-hero-section {
      padding: 34px 0 18px;
    }

    .home-hero-card-v2 {
      padding: 26px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(1100px 560px at 0% 0%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.07), transparent 42%),
        radial-gradient(820px 360px at 100% 10%, rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.08), transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.04), rgba(255,255,255,.018));
    }

    .home-hero-topline,
    .home-kicker-v2,
    .home-pillar-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.92);
    }

    .home-hero-main {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(280px, 0.95fr);
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .home-hero-copy h1 {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 14ch;
      line-height: 1.06;
      letter-spacing: -0.028em;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3.25rem);
    }

    .home-lead-v2 {
      margin: 16px 0 0;
      max-width: 60ch;
      font-size: 1.04rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: rgba(231, 238, 247, 0.9);
    }

    .home-hero-actions-v2 {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .home-primary-btn-v2 {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(125,211,252,.24), rgba(125,211,252,.11));
      border-color: rgba(156,223,255,.44);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(24, 74, 102, 0.18);
    }

    .home-hero-links-v2 {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .home-hero-links-v2 a {
      color: rgba(220, 236, 247, 0.9);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-hero-links-v2 a:hover,
    .home-text-link-v2:hover {
      color: #8bdcff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-hero-note-v2 {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      max-width: 54ch;
      font-size: 0.91rem;
      line-height: 1.58;
      color: rgba(167, 182, 201, 0.95);
    }

    .home-hero-pillars {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .home-pillar-link {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 15px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition:
        background-color 0.18s ease,
        border-color 0.18s ease,
        box-shadow 0.18s ease,
        transform 0.18s ease;
    }

    .home-pillar-link:hover,
    .home-pillar-link:focus-visible,
    .home-article-link-v2:hover,
    .home-article-link-v2:focus-visible,
    .home-model-card-v2:hover,
    .home-model-card-v2:focus-within {
      background: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.16);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.10);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-pillar-link strong {
      font-size: 1.04rem;
    }

    .home-pillar-link span:last-child {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.58;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
    }

    .home-journal-section-v2,
    .home-model-section-v2,
    .home-tags-section-v2 {
      padding: 8px 0 18px;
    }

    .home-journal-grid-v2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(320px, 0.92fr);
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .home-section-head-v2 {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .home-section-head-v2--compact {
      align-items: center;
    }

    .home-section-head-v2 h2 {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .home-section-intro-v2 {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.64;
      max-width: 62ch;
    }

    .home-section-intro-v2.compact {
      margin-top: 6px;
      max-width: 50ch;
    }

    .home-text-link-v2 {
      color: rgba(220, 236, 247, 0.88);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .home-edito-visual {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 14px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-edito-visual img {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 8.4;
    }

    .home-edito-actions {
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .home-article-list-v2 {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .home-article-item-v2 {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .home-article-link-v2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 112px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: start;
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      transition:
        background-color 0.18s ease,
        border-color 0.18s ease,
        box-shadow 0.18s ease,
        transform 0.18s ease;
    }

    .home-article-link-v2--compact {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .home-article-thumb-v2 {
      width: 112px;
      height: 76px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .home-article-thumb-v2 img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .home-article-copy-v2 {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .home-article-meta-v2 {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .home-article-copy-v2 h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.36;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .home-article-link-v2:hover h3,
    .home-article-link-v2:focus-visible h3 {
      color: #8bdcff;
    }

    .home-article-copy-v2 p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.93rem;
      line-height: 1.56;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .home-model-grid-v2 {
      margin-top: 8px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .home-model-card-v2 {
      position: relative;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      transition:
        background-color 0.18s ease,
        border-color 0.18s ease,
        box-shadow 0.18s ease,
        transform 0.18s ease;
    }

    .home-model-overlay-v2 {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 2;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .home-model-card-inner-v2 {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 14px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .home-model-media-v2 {
      width: 96px;
      height: 68px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .home-model-media-v2 img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }

    .home-model-copy-v2 {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .home-model-topline-v2 {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .home-model-topline-v2 h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      line-height: 1.34;
    }

    .home-model-copy-v2 p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.56;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
    }

    .home-model-tags-v2,
    .home-theme-pills-v2 {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .home-model-tag-v2 {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-tags-wrap-v2 {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .home-tag-lines-v2 {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .home-tag-line-v2 {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    }

    .home-tag-line-v2 strong {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .home-hero-main,
      .home-journal-grid-v2 {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .home-hero-copy h1 {
        max-width: 16ch;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .home-model-grid-v2 {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .home-hero-section {
        padding-top: 28px;
      }

      .home-hero-card-v2 {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .home-hero-copy h1 {
        max-width: none;
      }

      .home-article-link-v2 {
        grid-template-columns: 88px minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .home-article-thumb-v2 {
        width: 88px;
        height: 64px;
      }

      .home-model-card-inner-v2 {
        grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .home-model-media-v2 {
        width: 80px;
        height: 60px;
      }

      .home-model-topline-v2 {
        flex-direction: column;
